sequenceDiagram
  actor Dev as Developer
  participant UI as self-service UI<br/>(Scaffolder form / AAResourcePicker)
  participant Scaffolder as Backstage Scaffolder<br/>(backend)
  participant Action as scaffolder-backend-module<br/>aapCreateJobTemplate / aapLaunchJobTemplate
  participant Client as AAPClient<br/>(backstage-rhaap-common)
  participant AAP as Ansible Automation Platform

  Dev->>UI: Fill template form<br/>(project, EE, inventory, credentials)
  UI->>Scaffolder: Submit task (templateRef + values)
  Scaffolder->>Action: run(ctx) for each step

  Action->>Client: createProject() / createJobTemplate()
  Client->>AAP: POST /api/v2/projects, /job_templates
  AAP-->>Client: 201 Created + resource id

  Action->>Client: launchJobTemplate(id)
  Client->>AAP: POST /api/v2/job_templates/{id}/launch/
  AAP-->>Client: 202 Accepted + job id

  loop poll until complete
    Client->>AAP: GET /api/v2/jobs/{id}/
    AAP-->>Client: status: pending/running/successful
  end

  Client-->>Action: job result
  Action-->>Scaffolder: step output (job id, status, logs URL)
  Scaffolder-->>UI: task complete
  UI-->>Dev: Show job status & links
